! Read by SOCA applications only, after MOM_override. Empty for this domain.
!
! It exists because `model.override` names it and `ackbar validate` stats what
! that names, so an absent file is a typo and an empty one is a decision.
!
! The regional domains use this file to turn their open boundaries off for SOCA
! and only for SOCA, working around a MOM6 that refuses to configure Flather
! boundaries in the non-symmetric build SOCA links. A global domain has no open
! boundaries, so there is nothing here to work around. Read
! config/model/mom6sis2/domain/gom/25km/MOM_override.soca for what that is and
! when it goes away.
